{
  "info": {
    "name": "GoGinMoneyCopilot",
    "description": "GoGinMoneyCopilot — tum endpoint'ler.\n\nKULLANIM SIRASI\n1. Auth > Register (bir kez)\n2. Auth > Login  -> access_token otomatik kaydedilir\n3. Accounts > Create, sonra account_id degiskenini elle gir\n4. Categories > List -> category_id otomatik kaydedilir\n5. Geri kalan her sey calisir\n\nDEGISKENLER\nbase_url, access_token, account_id, category_id, transaction_id, action_token\n\nNOTLAR\n- Bearer token koleksiyon seviyesinde tanimli; public istekler 'No Auth' ile ezildi.\n- Refresh token HttpOnly cookie'dir; Postman cookie'yi kendisi tasir, elle bir sey yapma.\n- Test script'leri sadece Postman kolayligidir (token kopyalamamak icin).\n  Uygulama kodu degildir, frontend'e de girmez.\n- POST endpoint'leri olusturulan kaydin id'sini DONDURMUYOR; id gereken yerde\n  once GET/List cagirman gerekiyor.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "account_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "category_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "transaction_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "action_token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 - Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/register",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "username: 3-20 karakter, sadece harf+rakam. password: 8-30 karakter.\nIP basina rate limit var (AUTH_RATE_PER_MIN, varsayilan 10/dk).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"testuser\",\n  \"password\": \"dogrusifre123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Access token GOVDEDE doner (frontend bellekte tutar).\nRefresh token HttpOnly cookie olarak set edilir (Path=/auth).\nTest script'i token'i access_token degiskenine yazar.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"testuser\",\n  \"password\": \"dogrusifre123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const t = pm.response.json().token;",
                  "    if (t) { pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', t); }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Govde YOK. Kimlik refresh cookie'sinden gelir.\nHer cagrida token DONER (rotation): eski cookie gecersizlesir.\nAyni cookie'yi ikinci kez kullanirsan sizinti sayilir ve TUM oturumlar iptal edilir.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const t = pm.response.json().token;",
                  "    if (t) { pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', t); }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Uc is birden: cookie temizlenir, refresh token DB'de iptal edilir,\naccess token'in jti'si denylist'e yazilir."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
